## ADF - used for ETL, data integration and data movement    
Used to create and schedule data driven pipelines

"ADF was the orchestration layer."    

I used Azure Data Factory as the orchestration layer to automate the extraction and movement of data from multiple sources into SQL Server.      
I created pipelines with activities for ingestion, staging, validation and transformation, and then used SQL Server for the relational transformations       
and analytical data model that was consumed by Power BI.     


